        "wire-2026-10-27-2004-arc-2-gold-cutoff-changes-hands"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs leads at 88.06, followed by Yi-Chia Chen @ Fields Model at 84.72 and Domdolus Tolus at 82.08. この遥かなる旅路に祝福を, whose observed roster includes Keith Tyser, holds 16th at 69.72. The wire’s earlier report of its move into the final gold place predates the overnight comparison: the cutoff has held since that baseline. Public medal positions remain provisional."
    },
